-- @@ comment TABLE public.ottoq_run_archives
COMMENT ON TABLE public.ottoq_run_archives IS E'Durable per-run record written by ottoq_sim_stop_and_reset BEFORE it wipes the twin. Holds the reproducibility key (scenario + random_seed + policy + depot) and the outcome metrics, so a stopped run can be re-created or analysed after ottoq_start_demo_run purges its raw rows. Deliberately does NOT store the full ~24MB black-box bundle while ottoq_events is at its capacity ceiling.';
-- @@ comment VIEW public.ottoq_approach_band
COMMENT ON VIEW public.ottoq_approach_band IS E'DERIVED approach band (Zones A/B/C). A=OPEN (en route, not yet approached; cuOpt may re-optimize, reservations PROVISIONAL). B=FROZEN (approached OR entered; no override). C=RE-OPENED (hardware malfunction or flag; MUST route through the in-depot reassignment guard). The boundary is APPROACHED (minutes_out <= approach_freeze_minutes), which is strictly EARLIER than arrived_at_gate; arrived_at_gate is only one member of the entered set, never the boundary test. FAIL-CLOSED: unknown ETA => Zone B, never Zone A. Congestion is NOT wired as a Zone C trigger - no per-vehicle signal exists.';
-- @@ comment TABLE public.vehicle_need_profile
